{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅くなってごめんなさい；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、しっかりとデビュー日に\n更新したかったんですが、\n新しいブログのシステムの\nやり方がわからず...不覚です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、いよいよ\n乃木坂46 はデビュー を迎えまして、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからが本当のスタートだと\n思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けたくないです。自分に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れたくないです。大切なこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんへの感謝、\nメンバーへの感謝、\n友人や家族への感謝、、\n今までのことも全部全部、\n無駄にしたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に自分に厳しくしていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、インフルエンザに\nかかってしまったゆみ姉さんの\n代わりに、千葉県の成田へ\n握手会に行かせて頂きました  ***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵なデビュー日に\nなりました！\n有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日は地元埼玉！\n埼玉県だいすきです(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて泣いてしまって\nごめんなさい。\n本当に私は幸せ者です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配させちゃった方、申し訳なかったです。\n皆さん本当に有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、誠心誠意頑張って\nいきますので、\n宜しくお願い致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/24/6561694/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyan。"}],"source":"archive"}